# Who must approve a change before it can go live. The CMS saves every change as a pull request; GitHub only lets
# it merge (publish) once someone listed here for those files has approved it. Maintainers can publish anything
# without an approval. Teams and their members: https://github.com/orgs/Cyberheaven/teams
# The last matching line wins, so the general rule comes first.

# Everything: pages, settings, labs, the CMS, the site's code
*                         @Cyberheaven/maintainers

# Articles, team profiles and their images: editors can approve these too
/src/content/articles/    @Cyberheaven/editors @Cyberheaven/maintainers
/src/content/people/      @Cyberheaven/editors @Cyberheaven/maintainers
/public/media/            @Cyberheaven/editors @Cyberheaven/maintainers
